  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - On account of its improper design and excessive size, the proposed extensions would cumulatively result in an obtrusive development and fail to remain subservient to the main house, causing harm to its character and visual appearance, and surrounding conservation area. This would be contrary to policies CC1 (Context and Character), CC4 (Heritage), SC7 (Residential Extensions and Alterations) of the adopted Local Plan (2015) and the intentions of the adopted Residential Extension Guidelines SPD. ",
    "Reason : 2 - Given its excessive size, siting and noting existing site constraints within the neighbouring property, the proposed ground floor side and rear extensions would cause harm to the living conditions of its neighbour at No.9 by loss of light. The applicant has not submitted any details to demonstrate otherwise. This would be contrary to Local Plan policies CC2 (Urban Design and Architecture), SC7 (Residential Extensions and Alterations) and the intentions of the adopted Residential Extension Guidelines SPD. "
  ],
